blurb = "Depicts four kyōka (comic poetry) poets reading a scroll.

Despite the title, there are only 4 people depicted. There are 3 other prints in the set, each depicting 4 possibly different people.

You may see this print attributed to Yajima Gogaku. which was an alias used by Yashima Gakutei."
